{"id":"wb-3-28","name":"中国工农红军第七军、第八军军部旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"中国工农红军第七军、第八军军部旧址","text":"中国工农红军第七军、第八军军部旧址，是位于中华人民共和国的广西省百色市和崇左市龙州县的一处全国重点文物保护单位。囊括曾作为中国工农红军第七军军部的百色粤东会馆、中国工农红军第七军政治部的清风楼、曾作为中国工农红军第八军军部的瑞丰祥钱庄等近代建筑群。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%B7%A5%E5%86%9C%E7%BA%A2%E5%86%9B%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E5%86%9B%E3%80%81%E7%AC%AC%E5%85%AB%E5%86%9B%E5%86%9B%E9%83%A8%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93565688,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93565688","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4b9579800a61c0c4e1c17f2c.jpg","title":"Former_site_of_the_Headquarters_of_the_7th_Army_of_Chinese_Workers'_and_Peasants'_Red_Army_(20230403090249).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Former_site_of_the_Headquarters_of_the_7th_Army_of_Chinese_Workers%27_and_Peasants%27_Red_Army_(20230403090249).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e0/Former_site_of_the_Headquarters_of_the_7th_Army_of_Chinese_Workers%27_and_Peasants%27_Red_Army_%2820230403090249%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"N509FZ","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Commanders' headquarters of Baise Uprising in 1929.","width":320,"height":213}}